{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 20, :comments ["<b>By you shall Israel bless.</b> One who comes to bless his sons shall bless them with their blessing and say, each man to his son: 'May Elohim make you like Efraim and like Menashe.'" "<b>And he placed Efraim.</b> In his blessing before Menashe — to precede him in the standards and in the dedication of the princes."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 48, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:03:58.360733587Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}